      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vienna",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Vienna’s name comes from the Roman castrum Vindobona, established in the 1st century on the Danube frontier.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
